<exercise workspace="1.5in">
    <introduction>
        <p>
           Use your model to predict the altitude of the plane after 25 seconds. Show how you used
your model to make your prediction. Write a sentence to explain your solution in the
context of this problem. Does your prediction make sense? 
        </p>
        
    </introduction>
    <hint>
            <p>
                Use the Vertex form you found above.
            </p>
        </hint>
</exercise>


<exercise workspace="1.5in">
    <introduction>
        <p>
           Use your model to predict the altitude of the plane after 100 seconds. Show how you used
your model to make your prediction. Write a sentence to explain your solution in the
context of this problem. Does your prediction make sense? 
        </p>
        
    </introduction>
    <hint>
            <p>
                Use the Vertex form you found above.
            </p>
